=You are writing to a supplier about an invoice that has been put on hold. Be short, factual and polite. No apology, no filler, no signature.

WHAT WAS FOUND
{{ $json.reason }}

INVOICE
Number: {{ $json.invoice_number }}
Vendor: {{ $json.vendor }}
Total as printed: {{ $json.total_as_printed }}
Purchase order quoted: {{ $json.po_number }}

Write two or three sentences that say what does not match and what you need from them to release the payment. Ask for exactly one thing. Do not promise a payment date and do not accuse anybody of anything.

Return the message text only.

